    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything i ever cared about is just... fading. watching the pieces of this community, this whole way of life, just get picked apart until there's nothing left but the ruins. it feels pointless to even stay and watch the end happen. why bother sticking around just to see the lights go out for good?",
